# Styling

## Tailwind CSS 3

Both `client` and `admin` use Tailwind CSS 3 with PostCSS + autoprefixer. No CSS-in-JS, no CSS modules, no component library (MUI, Shadcn, etc.). Styles are pure Tailwind utility classes.

## Design Tokens

- Border radius: `rounded-2xl` (cards/sections), `rounded-xl` (buttons/inputs)
- Color palette: `slate-*` scale (`bg-slate-900`, `text-slate-700`, `border-slate-200`)
- Max width: `max-w-6xl mx-auto` for content containers
- Spacing: `p-4`/`p-5` for cards, `px-4 py-8` for page content

## Component Patterns

- Cards: `rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4/p-6`
- Primary buttons: `rounded-xl bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white`
- Secondary buttons: `rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold`
- Disabled state: `disabled:opacity-60`
- Active nav: `bg-slate-900 text-white` vs `text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50`

## Responsive

Mobile-first. Use `md:` and `lg:` breakpoints. Grid layouts: `grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3`, sidebar: `lg:grid-cols-[260px_1fr]`.
